# Six damage to our own 6/6 Elder Gargaroth (put onto the battlefield by Show and Tell) is exactly lethal: no excess
# was dealt, so Violent Echoes empowers nothing and no Jace token is made (CR 120.4a, 120.10). Jace's absence is the
# point: a 0-loyalty token would be made and then die (CR 701.71a, 704.5i), which only an empty battlefield and
# LeftBattlefield tell apart.
[Bot1 Deck]
Show and Tell
Elder Gargaroth
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Island
Violent Echoes
Black Lotus
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Elder Gargaroth)
Bot2.Choose()
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Violent Echoes.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Elder Gargaroth)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
LeftBattlefield = Black Lotus (tapped); Black Lotus (tapped); Elder Gargaroth
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Ruby
